 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.<br /> <br />This mid-month patch will see a rework to two of everyone&rsquo;s first characters, Black Widow and Captain America. The rework will some major changes to their skills, as well as a few other quality of life additions to their tool kits to improve their overall performance<br /> <br />These changes will not apply until after the Mid-Month update is applied to the game. Due to the extent of the reworks, there will also be a brief maintenance period.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #ed7d31; mso-themecolor: accent2;\">Character Balancing</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">We&rsquo;re brushing the dust of Captain America&rsquo;s shield and sharpening Black Widow&rsquo;s skills this balance patch. Both characters will be receiving a sizable rework to modernize their kits a little bit more. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #2f5496; mso-themecolor: accent5; mso-themeshade: 191;\">Captain America<br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Captain America and all his uniforms have been reworked. The character has considerable improvements to his skills, helping to improve both damage and survivability. <br /> <br /> <strong>All Uniforms<br /> <br /> </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Normal Attack</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <br />- Attack Range has been slightly increased<br /> <br /> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Shield Throw</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <br />- Shield Throw animation has been improved. <br />- Now gives Immune to All Damage (3 sec.) <br /> <br /> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Valor <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Range has been improved<br />- Enemy Units will now be pulled into the attack animation when pushed. <br /> <br /> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Shield Strike<br />-</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Attack Range Increased<br />- Cooldown Time decreased from <span style=\"color: red;\">8 Seconds </span>to <strong><span style=\"color: #00b050;\">7 Seconds</span></strong><br />- Push effect on certain uniforms has been improved<br />- Spinning effect on certain uniforms now collects enemies in front of Captain America. <br /> <br /> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Heroic Fury<br />-</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> Shield projectile now hits more enemies<br />- Dash range increased so it can attack from longer distances, spinning motions now collects enemies in front of Captain America<br /> <br /> <br /> <strong><span style=\"color: #2f5496; mso-themecolor: accent5; mso-themeshade: 191;\">Captain America (Secret Wars: 2099) </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ready for Battle<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">- Attack range increased allowing the skill to be activated from further away. <br /> <br /> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Shield Strike<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">- Knockback reduced on the downward strike to prevent opponents from spreading out. <br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /> <!--[endif]--></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #2f5496; mso-themecolor: accent5; mso-themeshade: 191;\">Captain America (Captain America : Winter Soldier) <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Shield Strike <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Knockback reduced on the downward strike to prevent opponents from spreading out.<br /> <br /> <strong><span style=\"color: #2f5496; mso-themecolor: accent5; mso-themeshade: 191;\">Captain America (Marvel Now!)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Shield Strike<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Knockback reduced on the downward strike to prevent opponents from spreading out.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #1f4e79; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 128;\">Black Widow<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Black widow is being reworked to increase her versatility and improve a little bit of her survivability. </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />All Uniforms<br /> <br /> </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Normal Attack</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />- Attack range increased slightly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Widow&rsquo;s Bite</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />- Skill animation improved</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Acrobatic Assault</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br />- Range increased during the attack part of the animation<br />- Added I-&#70;rames to the Backflip animation<br />- Increased range for the skill activation (you can activate the skill from a further distance than before). <br />- Damage increased slightly <br /> <br /> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Systema<br />-</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Increased range of the skill<br />- Increased range of effect <br />- Added a slight dash when activated from distance<br />- Damage of the last electric attack animation improved<br /> <span style=\"color: #1f4e79; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 128;\"><br /> <strong>Black Widow (The Avengers) </strong></span><strong><br /> <br /> </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Infiltrator <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Full I-&#102;rame added <br />- Cool down time decreased from <span style=\"color: red;\">30 seconds </span>to <strong><span style=\"color: #00b050;\">12 seconds</span><br />-</strong> Buff duration decreased from <span style=\"color: red;\">20 seconds </span>to <strong><span style=\"color: #00b050;\">8 seconds</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; color: #1f4e79; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 128;\">Black Widow (Secret Wars: 2099) </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> <br /> </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Infiltrator <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Full I-&#102;rame added <br /> <br /> <strong><span style=\"color: #1f4e79; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 128;\">Black Widow (Captain America: Civil War) </span><br /> </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">▶</span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Pistol Strafe<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">- Full I-&#102;rame added <br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 8pt;\">*Final details are subject to change</span><br /> <br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%;\">World Boss Ultimate: Corvus Glaive Added</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> <br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">The Heart stopper, Corvus Glaive has been upgraded and makes his World Boss Ultimate Debut. Prepare to face your demons in Orollan one more time. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\"><br /> <br /> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\">Other Changes<br /> </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">1)</span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 107%;\">Fixed an issue with Friend&rsquo;s Assistance, where the scale of Baby Groot would be incorrect. <br />2) Fixed an issue in World Boss Dimension Rift where <strong>Black Dwarf</strong>&nbsp;was not stunned once her shield has been broken.&nbsp;</span></p>"
